name: PerkeoCanioGhostImmolate
author: pi
description: Ghost deck — Perkeo + Canio legendary pair with Immolate appearing in shop items [0,1,2] for early-ante consumable acceleration.
deck: Ghost
stake: White
hashtags: ["ghost", "perkeo", "canio", "immolate", "legendary-pair", "shop-items"]

must:
  - legendaryJoker: Perkeo
    antes: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]
  - legendaryJoker: Canio
    antes: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]
  - spectral: Immolate
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2]
